Input: {"question": "Which sports team does Mario Magnozzi represent or represent?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 62, "text": "Title: The Rossoneri Legacy: Mario Magnozzi's AC Milan Odyssey"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 64, "end": 229, "text": "In the heart of Milan, Italy, where the Duomo's grandeur pierces the sky and the fashion world converges, a different kind of artistry unfolds on the football pitch."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 230, "end": 356, "text": "AC Milan, one of the most storied clubs in the world, has been the stage for countless legends to etch their names in history."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 357, "end": 481, "text": "Among them is Mario Magnozzi, an Italian footballer and manager who left an indelible mark on the Rossoneri's rich tapestry."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 482, "end": 606, "text": "The year was 1954, and Magnozzi, a talented defender from the Tuscan region, was making waves in the Italian football scene."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 607, "end": 770, "text": "His impressive performances for his hometown club, Empoli, caught the attention of AC Milan's scouts, who were on the hunt for fresh talent to bolster their squad."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 771, "end": 952, "text": "The opportunity to join the seven-time Italian champions was too enticing to resist, and Magnozzi made the move to Milan, donning the iconic red and black jersey for the first time."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 953, "end": 1054, "text": "As Magnozzi took to the San Siro pitch, he was surrounded by some of the greatest players of the era."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1055, "end": 1236, "text": "The likes of Gunnar Nordahl, Juan Alberto Schiaffino, and Nils Liedholm formed a formidable squad, and Magnozzi's tenacity and vision quickly earned him a starting spot in the team."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1237, "end": 1392, "text": "Under the guidance of legendary coach, Béla Guttmann, AC Milan was on a mission to reclaim the Scudetto, and Magnozzi played a pivotal role in their quest."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1393, "end": 1471, "text": "The 1954-1955 season would prove to be a defining moment in Magnozzi's career."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1472, "end": 1596, "text": "As AC Milan navigated the treacherous waters of Serie A, Magnozzi's defensive prowess and leadership qualities shone bright."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1597, "end": 1735, "text": "He formed a formidable partnership with fellow defender, Franco Pedroni, and together they marshaled the Rossoneri's backline with aplomb."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1736, "end": 1921, "text": "The team's 3-2 victory over arch-rivals, Inter Milan, on November 14, 1954, showcased Magnozzi's ability to read the game and make crucial interceptions, earning him widespread acclaim."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1922, "end": 2002, "text": "As the season drew to a close, AC Milan's title aspirations hung in the balance."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2003, "end": 2091, "text": "With three matches remaining, the Rossoneri trailed leaders, Udinese, by a single point."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 110, "text": "**HEADLINE:** Italian Footballer Mario Magnozzi Makes Shocking Move to Russian Club FC Nara-ShBFR Naro-Fominsk"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 112, "end": 346, "text": "**MOSCOW, RUSSIA** - In a surprise transfer that has sent shockwaves through the football world, Italian footballer Mario Magnozzi has signed with Russian club FC Nara-ShBFR Naro-Fominsk, sources close to the deal confirmed yesterday."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 347, "end": 563, "text": "The 29-year-old midfielder, who has had stints with top-tier Italian clubs including AC Milan and Inter Milan, is said to have inked a three-year deal with the Russian outfit, reportedly worth €2.5 million per annum."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 564, "end": 715, "text": "\"I'm thrilled to join FC Nara-ShBFR Naro-Fominsk and be a part of this exciting project,\" Magnozzi said in an exclusive interview with our publication."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 716, "end": 830, "text": "\"The club's vision and ambition align with my own, and I'm looking forward to contributing to the team's success.\""}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 831, "end": 976, "text": "Magnozzi, known for his vision and passing range, has made over 200 appearances in Italy's top flight, scoring 25 goals and providing 40 assists."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 977, "end": 1147, "text": "His experience and leadership qualities are expected to be a significant boost to FC Nara-ShBFR Naro-Fominsk, who finished 10th in the Russian Premier League last season."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1148, "end": 1256, "text": "\"We're delighted to welcome Mario to our team,\" said FC Nara-ShBFR Naro-Fominsk's manager, Sergey Kuznetsov."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1257, "end": 1397, "text": "\"His quality and experience will undoubtedly strengthen our squad, and we're confident he'll be a key player for us in the upcoming season.\""}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1398, "end": 1515, "text": "The move is seen as a major coup for the Russian club, who have been quietly building a strong squad in recent years."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1516, "end": 1682, "text": "FC Nara-ShBFR Naro-Fominsk's owner, billionaire businessman Igor Petrov, has invested heavily in the team, and the signing of Magnozzi is a clear statement of intent."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1683, "end": 1803, "text": "\"We're committed to making FC Nara-ShBFR Naro-Fominsk a top-tier club in Russia and Europe,\" Petrov said in a statement."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1804, "end": 1916, "text": "\"The signing of Mario Magnozzi is a significant step in that direction, and we're excited to see him in action.\""}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1917, "end": 2039, "text": "Magnozzi is expected to make his debut for FC Nara-ShBFR Naro-Fominsk in their season opener against FC Rostov on July 25."}}, "candidates": [], "original_cards": [], "initial_answers": ["AC Milan", "FC Nara-ShBFR Naro-Fominsk"]}
